# Rail Fault Detection System 

## How to create a suitable enviromental variable
1. conda create -n project_env python=3.10
2. conda activate railway_env
3. pip install tensorflow matplotlib pandas jupyter scikit-learn

## Avoiding Merge Conflicts 
* Before each git commit press "Clear All Output" in the notebook. 
* If possible, make every thing modular and move it to its own .py file. Then import it in the notebook